<section class="project-promo" data-project-promo aria-label="프로젝트 소개" aria-live="off">
    <div class="project-promo__viewport">
        <a class="project-promo__slide project-promo__slide--poli is-active"
           data-project-promo-slide
           href="https://poli.it.kr"
           target="_blank"
           rel="noopener noreferrer"
           aria-hidden="false">
            <span class="project-promo__meta">
                <span class="project-promo__badge">PROJECT AD</span>
                <span class="project-promo__name">POLI</span>
            </span>
            <span class="project-promo__copy">
                <strong>내 관심사로 받아보는 국회 소식 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong>
                <span>궁금한 주제를 맡겨두면 관련 법안과 진행 소식을 모아볼 수 있어요.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="project-promo__visual" aria-hidden="true">POLI</span>
        </a>

        <a class="project-promo__slide project-promo__slide--free-rider"
           data-project-promo-slide
           href="https://dohyeon-kr.github.io/free-rider/"
           target="_blank"
           rel="noopener noreferrer"
           aria-hidden="true"
           tabindex="-1">
            <span class="project-promo__meta">
                <span class="project-promo__badge">PROJECT AD</span>
                <span class="project-promo__name">FREE RIDER</span>
            </span>
            <span class="project-promo__copy">
                <strong>API 작업에 무임승차하세요 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong>
                <span>서버·계정 없이 요청 실행, 환경 변수, OpenAPI 동기화와 로컬 Git 작업까지.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="project-promo__visual" aria-hidden="true">FR</span>
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="project-promo__controls">
        <span class="project-promo__position" data-project-promo-position aria-hidden="true">01 / 02</span>
        <button class="project-promo__toggle"
                type="button"
                data-project-promo-toggle
                aria-label="프로젝트 배너 자동 전환 일시정지"
                aria-pressed="false">Ⅱ</button>
    </div>
</section>
